{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0065","name":"贞姜","evidence":["houfei-q-o038"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houfei-m-o038-houfei-p0065","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o038"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o038","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-10fa24c108af165ad605","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖4〗，帝东征，后留许昌永始台。时霖雨百余日，城楼多坏，有司奏请移止。后曰：“昔楚昭王出游〖5〗，贞姜留渐台〖6〗；江水至，使者迎而无符〖7〗，不去，卒没。今帝在远，吾幸未有是患；而便移止，奈何〖8〗？”群臣莫敢复言。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
